{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 35, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "Fair patron, thy journey to Japan, a land of elegance and grace, shall be planned with thee in mind. Upon thy arrival, thou shalt find thyself in Tokyo, a city as vibrant as the sun.\n\nThe first day, thou shalt visit the Imperial Palace, a testament to the grandeur of the past, and then proceed to the bustling streets of Akihabara, where modernity and tradition dance together.\n\nThe second morn, thou shalt embark on a journey to the serene Meiji Shrine, where the soul is cleansed, and then wander through the lively markets of Harajuku, where the youth of Japan express their creativity.\n\nOn the third day, thou shalt venture to the sacred mountain of Mount Fuji, whose peak pierces the clouds, and then visit the tranquil town of Hakone, where the waters soothe the spirit.\n\nThe fourth day, thou shalt explore the historic city of Kyoto, once the capital of Japan, and visit the majestic Kinkaku-ji, the Golden Pavilion, and the verdant Arashiyama Bamboo Grove.\n\nThe fifth morn, thou shalt delve into the cultural treasures of the Kyoto National Museum and then stroll through the traditional streets of Gion, where the geisha still tread lightly.\n\nLastly, on the sixth day, thou shalt return to Tokyo, where thou shalt find time to shop for souvenirs and enjoy the flavors of Japan in the many restaurants and bars.\n\nAnd thus, thy journey shall come to an end, but the memories of Japan shall forever remain in thy heart. Fare thee well, and may thy travels be as splendid as the tales of old.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Fair", "logprob": -2.7865729331970215}, {"token": " patron", "logprob": -10.944202423095703}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.5294791460037231}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -2.6331260204315186}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.429718017578125}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.12792924046516418}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -1.094